# VITE_EVALUATE_API_URL
#
# When set, the frontend will send activity-planning requests to the
# AWS Lambda /evaluate endpoint instead of computing recommendations locally.
# Leave unset (or comment out) to use the local computation path.
#
# Set this to your API Gateway HTTP API URL, WITHOUT a trailing slash:
# VITE_EVALUATE_API_URL=https://xxxxxxxxxx.execute-api.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/prod
